OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 16 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThis Thursday night, Soweto has
OL,12,     Gmore of the best in jazz from the
OL,13,     GUK and around the world.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GPianist Vadym Kholodenko joins
OL,16,     Gthe Norwegian Radio Orchestra and
OL,17,     Gconductor Leslie Suganandarajah
OL,18,     Gin Brahms's Second Piano
OL,19,     GConcerto, and the orchestra plays
OL,20,     GSchubert's 4th Symphony.
